      "extract": "Fractional Hopﬁons in the Faddeev-Skyrme model with a symmetry breaking potential A. Samoilenka† and Ya. Shnir†⋆ †Department of Theoretical Physics and Astrophysics Belarusian State University, Minsk 220004, Belarus ⋆BLTP, JINR, Dubna, Russia June 17, 2021 Abstract We construct new solutions of the Faddeev-Skyrme model with a symmetry breaking potential admitting S1 vacuum. It includes, as a limiting case, the usual",
