      "extract": "To find the stationary points of the energy functional ([\\[hopfenergy\\]](#hopfenergy){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"hopfenergy\"}) with the potential ([\\[potential\\]](#potential){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"potential\"}) we make use of the numerical minimization technique described in [@Samoilenka:2015bsf; @Samoilenka:2016wys]. The fields are discretized on the grid with $150^3$, or $200^3$ point with spatial",
